WEBVTT

00:04.240 --> 00:07.639
<i>The secrets of our arts
must never leave this clan.</i>

00:07.719 --> 00:11.560
<i>Under no circumstances
shall they be shared with outsiders.</i>

00:11.640 --> 00:14.400
Bear in mind your mission is your life.

00:14.480 --> 00:17.440
<i>We dedicate everything we do
to maintain peace</i>

00:17.519 --> 00:19.320
in the land of the rising sun.

00:20.679 --> 00:23.280
<i>A terrorist attack
on this scale is unprecedented.</i>

00:23.359 --> 00:26.199
<i>It has rocked the entire world
to its very core.</i>

00:26.280 --> 00:27.640
Due to recent events,

00:27.719 --> 00:30.920
<i>our organization shall leave
the jurisdiction of Japan</i>

00:31.000 --> 00:34.439
<i>and fall under a new authority
of a greater power.</i>

00:34.520 --> 00:39.240
<i>Therefore, the secrets of our arts
may now be shared with foreigners.</i>

00:41.119 --> 00:46.600
<i>Make no mistak,
we do this for the future of Japan.</i>

00:48.960 --> 00:52.719
<i>Any of those who disobey this decision
or defect because of it</i>

00:52.799 --> 00:56.280
<i>shall be branded
exiles and exterminated.</i>

01:03.119 --> 01:04.239
Higan...

01:12.640 --> 01:13.840
Daddy!

01:32.439 --> 01:36.879
Geez, this is quite a mess
you've gotten yourself into, Higan.

01:38.040 --> 01:40.799
What are you doing here?

01:41.480 --> 01:44.519
These guys
just can't keep it down in here.

01:44.840 --> 01:47.120
Didn't think I'd ever see you again.

01:47.200 --> 01:49.760
I thought we would meet in the afterlife.

02:17.199 --> 02:20.599
NINJA KAMUI

03:20.159 --> 03:22.039
It's a shame about Mari.

03:24.479 --> 03:26.240
Why don't you have your disguise on?

03:26.319 --> 03:28.400
The organization somehow found a way

03:28.479 --> 03:30.759
to see through the masking system
we've been using.

03:30.840 --> 03:34.520
- Impossible.
- Please remove it. It's useless now.

03:35.039 --> 03:39.319
I swear, why are you always beat
to hell whenever I see you?

03:39.759 --> 03:43.240
You're a doctor, aren't you?
Isn't it obvious?

03:44.759 --> 03:48.319
You used the secret art
of stark awareness?

03:52.479 --> 03:54.000
Never do it again.

03:54.879 --> 03:56.479
It will kill you next time.

03:57.280 --> 04:01.120
Wait, this doesn't make any sense.
Forget about the next time.

04:01.879 --> 04:04.560
You should have been dead
from this wound already.

04:04.639 --> 04:06.000
Yeah, I know.

04:06.639 --> 04:09.120
I don't understand
why I was the one who lived.

04:09.560 --> 04:11.840
It could just have been dumb luck.

04:11.919 --> 04:14.919
Or perhaps someone out there
is keeping you alive.

04:19.680 --> 04:22.439
Let's get started.
Even with your strength,

04:22.519 --> 04:26.079
it will take five or six days
before you can make a full recovery.

04:26.160 --> 04:29.720
I just need to be able to move. Then I get
answers from our guest out there.

04:30.040 --> 04:31.480
What comes after that?

04:31.560 --> 04:34.519
- I'm going to hunt them all down.
- By yourself?

04:34.600 --> 04:36.120
Are you volunteering to help?

04:38.600 --> 04:40.199
This shouldn't hurt.

04:42.720 --> 04:44.399
After it goes in, of course.

05:28.120 --> 05:32.680
You bastard!
Go ahead and do your worst.

05:32.759 --> 05:35.920
Is this all you got?
Remember, a ninja never cracks.

05:36.680 --> 05:37.720
Yes, I know.

05:48.519 --> 05:50.560
What are you trying to prove here?

05:50.920 --> 05:53.319
Just go ahead and kill me already!

06:11.800 --> 06:15.120
Oh, yeah.
I just remembered your woman.

06:15.600 --> 06:19.120
You should have seen the look
on her face. It was the best!

06:19.439 --> 06:22.120
The kid's reaction was just typical fear.

06:22.199 --> 06:26.680
But your woman, her eyes glared
with anger and hatred until the end.

06:26.759 --> 06:30.600
And, you know, the more I stabbed her,
the more she cried.

06:31.879 --> 06:32.959
Listen here.

06:35.399 --> 06:38.319
I'm going to burn their eyes
into your memory forever.

06:39.800 --> 06:42.600
You are about to be dropped
into the pits of hell,

06:43.000 --> 06:45.800
where you'll hear the sound of skin
being peeled off,

06:46.120 --> 06:49.800
bones being shattered,
and spines ripped out whole

06:49.879 --> 06:51.600
in spite of your heart stopping.

06:52.040 --> 06:54.720
There will be no sweet release of death.

06:54.800 --> 06:59.000
Even in oblivion, you'll tremble in
fear of the oni that lie beyond.

07:19.800 --> 07:21.160
Oh, come on.

07:21.720 --> 07:24.519
Why the hell are you taking me off
this investigation?

07:25.079 --> 07:27.480
You know we can't just pretend
that nothing happened.

07:31.160 --> 07:32.279
Emma!

07:36.360 --> 07:37.759
We've been over this already.

07:38.399 --> 07:41.879
Look, there's nothing we can do since we
don't know who the blood belongs to,

07:41.959 --> 07:44.560
nor do we have any surveillance footage
of what went on up there.

07:45.160 --> 07:46.720
That's just the reality of it.

07:47.439 --> 07:49.920
Regardless,
it's a direct order from the top.

07:50.000 --> 07:52.560
Don't get involved in this investigation
any further.

07:52.639 --> 07:55.399
I don't remember
you being such a Goddamn coward.

07:55.480 --> 07:56.600
Damn it, Mike.

07:56.680 --> 08:00.160
I'd hate to see you get terminated
right before you're about to retire.

08:00.240 --> 08:02.319
Just sit tight and pick up another case.

08:02.399 --> 08:04.920
What about Emma?
She saw everything.

08:05.000 --> 08:07.519
She saw Logan get attacked
by a group of assassins.

08:08.079 --> 08:09.720
Are you sure?

08:10.360 --> 08:12.839
I suggest that you try asking her again.

08:16.639 --> 08:18.000
Emma!

08:19.800 --> 08:23.399
Seriously? What the hell?
Don't just roll over like a dog.

08:23.480 --> 08:26.120
Oh, please.
There's no point in throwing a tantrum.

08:26.199 --> 08:29.319
The smarter play is just to appear
obedient on the surface.

08:29.680 --> 08:30.759
What does that mean?

08:31.199 --> 08:34.720
I almost laughed at how blatantly they're
trying to cover this up.

08:34.799 --> 08:37.320
Definitely something shady going on
with this case.

08:37.399 --> 08:38.879
We just need to play it cool.

08:38.960 --> 08:40.159
Unbelievable.

08:40.240 --> 08:43.480
So about the man who disappeared
from the hospital, Joe Logan.

08:43.559 --> 08:46.039
I did some digging into him
like you asked me to.

08:46.120 --> 08:47.720
This goes a lot deeper than just him.

08:47.799 --> 08:50.399
His wife, Sarah Logan,
and their son, Kyle Logan,

08:50.480 --> 08:53.960
the ones that were brutally murdered,
their names are all aliases.

08:54.480 --> 08:56.080
None of them actually exist.

08:57.080 --> 08:59.399
Turns out they're the same
as all the previous victims.

08:59.480 --> 09:01.480
So your intuition was right on the money.

09:01.559 --> 09:05.240
Ah, shit.
What the hell is going on here?

09:15.120 --> 09:16.879
It's finally ready.

09:17.200 --> 09:19.000
This will help protect everyone...

09:20.559 --> 09:21.679
including you.

10:42.399 --> 10:46.039
- Nice ass there, sexy.
- Hey! Get your hands off me, you creep!

10:51.919 --> 10:54.960
- This ain't near enough, buddy.
- That's all I can afford.

10:56.960 --> 10:57.879
Sorry, what did you say?

11:02.879 --> 11:05.240
Does that bike out front belong to you?

11:05.320 --> 11:09.240
There's been a rash of motorcycle thefts
around these parts lately.

11:09.320 --> 11:11.879
That ain't one of them, is it?

11:13.159 --> 11:15.559
Hey, boy, show me your license.

11:18.559 --> 11:20.240
Don't try and play dumb with me.

11:29.759 --> 11:32.000
You son of a bitch!

12:05.240 --> 12:08.519
So I see.
Looks like you're hard at work having fun.

12:08.600 --> 12:11.759
Criminals are doing deals
in VR these days, you know?

12:11.840 --> 12:13.399
You read the report, didn't you?

12:13.480 --> 12:15.679
We need to get this investigation
out of the way first.

12:15.759 --> 12:18.320
Otherwise,
we won't have time to go after Logan.

12:18.399 --> 12:21.240
I don't get the big deal
about virtual space or whatever.

12:21.320 --> 12:24.120
It's not like aliens gifted us
with the technology.

12:24.200 --> 12:27.200
Advancements in VR
have exploded like crazy.

12:27.279 --> 12:30.919
- And it's all thanks to AUZA.
- AUZA? That's great.

12:34.639 --> 12:36.559
Mike Moriss here.

12:37.720 --> 12:39.679
This is Joe Logan.

12:46.879 --> 12:50.159
I've been looking for you,
but Joe Logan doesn't exist.

12:50.240 --> 12:52.080
So who are you, really?

12:53.159 --> 12:56.919
I have some questions for you,
so let's talk.

12:57.000 --> 13:00.240
<i>What the hell do you mean?
We're talking right now, aren't we?</i>

13:01.399 --> 13:02.360
Damn it! Lost him.

13:04.559 --> 13:05.720
That you, Logan?

13:05.799 --> 13:08.919
Stop messing around.
This is your last chance.

13:09.000 --> 13:11.240
- Looks like somebody can't take a joke.
- I'm done with this.

13:11.320 --> 13:15.759
Hey, wait! Stay on the line. I'm sorry.
Don't hang up on me again.

13:16.240 --> 13:18.639
So, what do you want from me?

13:18.720 --> 13:22.279
- Give me a location.
- You're gonna let me decide?

13:23.559 --> 13:24.559
All right, then,

13:24.639 --> 13:27.840
let's meet up at this Chinese restaurant
in St. Mark's called Long Hao Bao.

13:28.919 --> 13:30.759
I'll be there tomorrow night.

13:33.159 --> 13:35.000
FAILED

13:43.000 --> 13:44.759
"From the cradle to the grave."

13:45.080 --> 13:47.000
<i>Those words were
once used to describe</i>

13:47.080 --> 13:49.600
<i>the social-security system
of a certain country.</i>

13:49.919 --> 13:53.360
<i>However, there is something more
deserving of that phrase now.</i>

13:53.440 --> 13:55.320
And that is us here at AUZA.

13:56.120 --> 14:00.480
<i>From the cradle to the grave,
AUZA technology works to support you,</i>

14:00.559 --> 14:03.840
<i>your entire family,
all of your friends and loved ones</i>

14:03.919 --> 14:05.759
in every aspect of your life.

14:28.600 --> 14:30.399
What do you mean?
Your place is perfect.

14:30.480 --> 14:31.679
There's never any customers here.

14:32.120 --> 14:35.679
- Shut the hell up, jackass.
- I need you to take a long walk.

14:35.759 --> 14:38.360
Hey, this is my place.
Who do you think you are?

14:38.759 --> 14:41.879
- You don't get to order me around.
- Okay, relax, old man.

14:41.960 --> 14:45.320
I keep telling you, no more get-togethers
during my dinner rush.

14:45.399 --> 14:47.440
This is what dinner rush looks like?

14:47.519 --> 14:51.399
If one of the delivery guy shows up,
just tell him to check that table

14:51.480 --> 14:53.440
and make sure they get the right order.

14:53.519 --> 14:56.120
Hold up.
You're not using drones yet?

14:56.200 --> 14:58.600
Does this look like AUZA City to you?

15:04.600 --> 15:08.960
Remember, this is my shop. You're going
to have to pay for anything you break.

15:09.039 --> 15:10.720
I'll be back in 30 minutes.

15:11.399 --> 15:13.200
Pain in the ass.

15:15.600 --> 15:19.559
I was starting to think that maybe
you fell over and died somewhere.

15:20.080 --> 15:23.559
Let me see your face.
I want to make sure you're the real deal.

15:25.840 --> 15:27.639
That's not going to cut it, man.

15:28.440 --> 15:30.200
Hold on a sec.

15:30.879 --> 15:33.879
I'm surprised you're here.
I didn't think you'd show up.

15:33.960 --> 15:36.600
You're taking a big risk
of getting caught out here.

15:40.200 --> 15:44.480
- I didn't come here for small talk.
- So what do you want to know?

15:44.559 --> 15:47.919
Who's responsible for the serial murders.
You got any leads?

15:48.000 --> 15:50.759
- Maybe.
- Any small detail is fine.

15:51.559 --> 15:54.559
Are you going to return the favor
by answering my questions?

15:55.639 --> 15:56.559
Yes.

15:57.759 --> 15:59.399
Let me ask you this...

15:59.480 --> 16:02.519
Do I look like the type
to cut a deal with a suspect,

16:02.600 --> 16:04.559
or do you think I'd let them go free?

16:04.639 --> 16:07.039
Well, that's too bad.
Get down on your knees.

16:07.120 --> 16:08.480
Put your hands behind your head.

16:08.840 --> 16:11.240
Start talking.
Tell me about the hospital.

16:11.759 --> 16:15.399
AUZA Eats.
Gyoza, chili-fried shrimp, mapo tofu.

16:15.480 --> 16:17.399
Yep.
Looks like it's all here. Later.

16:19.559 --> 16:23.080
- Why didn't you make a break for it?
- Because we're not done talking.

16:23.159 --> 16:25.080
Trust me,
we're going to have a nice, long talk.

16:25.399 --> 16:27.120
AUZA Eats here.

16:27.200 --> 16:30.879
Fried rice, egg roll, twice-cooked pork.
Got it. Thanks.

16:32.799 --> 16:34.879
Don't try anything funny.

16:40.360 --> 16:43.440
Get up.
I'm arresting you here now.

16:46.919 --> 16:49.840
Order's on the table. Just find it and go.

17:05.799 --> 17:07.440
Who is that?

17:15.359 --> 17:18.240
Freeze! Don't move! You too!

18:31.759 --> 18:33.319
Come on, man, I gotta know.

18:34.200 --> 18:35.920
Who the hell are you?

18:38.960 --> 18:40.359
Peking duck.

18:42.240 --> 18:44.839
Where's the guy from the hospital?
Answer me!

18:46.680 --> 18:48.759
I am a ninja.

18:49.680 --> 18:50.599
What the hell?

18:51.799 --> 18:54.880
Same with these guys and the ones
who attacked me at the hospital.

18:55.440 --> 19:00.440
Ninjas? I've heard talk on the street,
but no way.

19:01.160 --> 19:04.960
So that means all of the serial murders
are actually...

19:27.279 --> 19:28.319
Let's go!

19:36.759 --> 19:38.160
Hey, where are you?

19:41.480 --> 19:42.519
Goddamn.

19:53.559 --> 19:54.480
Unbelievable.

19:54.920 --> 19:57.319
This thing slashed
right through my body armor.

19:57.400 --> 19:59.640
There's not a scratch on any of this.

19:59.720 --> 20:04.240
What kind of alien crap is this?
Who on Earth made these blades?

20:04.319 --> 20:07.599
<i>Here at AUZA,
from the cradle to the grave,</i>

20:07.680 --> 20:09.960
AUZA technology works to support you,

20:10.359 --> 20:13.640
<i>your entire family,
all of your friends and loved ones</i>

20:13.720 --> 20:16.119
in every aspect of your life.

20:26.960 --> 20:27.880
Yes, Zai?

20:29.640 --> 20:32.480
I'm afraid he's still alive, Master.

20:38.480 --> 20:40.119
Higan.

20:44.000 --> 20:48.920
Subtitling
FAST TITLES MEDIA
